<p>With a gesture of your cloak, you drop a small incendiary device in front of you, creating a wall of thick steam of <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">3, 5, 5, 7, 7</acronym> length that burns creatures passing it for <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>steampower 100">146, 197, 236, 269, 299</acronym> fire damage and blocks sight for 5 turns.</p><p>At level 5 the action is so perfect that your foes even lose track of you entirely.</p><p>Damage increases with your steampower.</p>